{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/items/9620/", "pk": 9620, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/", "pk": 260, "shortname": "enoatours", "name": "E Noa Corporation", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Pearl Harbor Remembered A - from Waikiki", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 8, "unicode": "Pearl Harbor Remembered A - from Waikiki", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 5.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 5.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": false, "sortable_index": -1000, "description": "##Start Time and Duration\n\n**From Waikiki**\nPickup Tour 66A: 6:30AM-6:50AM\nReturn: Approximately 1:30PM\n\n##About\nExplore the powerfully moving historic sites that mark Oahu's place in World War II: Pearl Harbor, the USS Arizona and the USS Missouri. \n\n**Stops and sites on the Pearl Harbor Remembered Tour include:**\n\n- WWII Valor in the Pacific Monument & USS Arizona Memorial\n- USS Missouri Battleship on Ford Island\n- Historic Downtown Honolulu (drive through only)\n\n**What to know**\n\n- Security restrictions at Pearl Harbor will been forced.  Please do not bring large bags or anything that could offer concealment.  Storage is available at Pearl Harbor for $8.00.\n- Attire: Dress comfortably, but please remember that shirts and shoes are required on the USS Arizona Memorial; swimsuits not permitted.  High heels, dresses and skirts not recommended.  \n- Snacks are available at the USS Arizona Memorial Visitor Center and the USS Missouri gift shop.\n- Driver reserves right to adjust route for maximum visitor enjoyment and safety.\n- Be ready for spur-of-the-moment stops, unexpected views and special sightseeing along the way!\n\n**NOTE: DUE TO UNFORESEEN CIRCUMSTANCES BEYOND OUR CONTROL, THE NAVY MAY SUSPEND BOAT OPERATIONS TO THE USS ARIZONA MEMORIAL AT ANY TIME.  IN SUCH CASES, THERE WILL BE NO REFUNDS.  YOU CAN STILL ENJOY USS ARIZONA FILM, EXHIBITS, VISITOR'S CENTER AND PARK MONUMENTS.\n\n**Important Information**\n\n- Cancellations within 24 hours of tour are subject to a cancellation fee. \n\n- Please call to reconfirm your tour at least 24 hours prior.\n\n- Please report any disability requiring special attention at time of booking.  E Noa will make all reasonable attempts to accommodate the visitor’s needs.\n\n- All reservations subject to availability with departure times, dates, schedules and fares subject to change without notice.\n\n- E Noa Corporation shall not be liable for any injury, loss, damage, or accident to persons or property of any individual on tour from any cause beyond its control.\n\n*Attention:* Due to construction and lane closures surrounding Pearl Harbor, delays may occur on Pearl Harbor Tours.\n\nWe thank you for your consideration and cooperation in this matter.\n\nMahalo", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Stops and sites on the Pearl Harbor Remembered Tour include:##\n\no   WWII Valor in the Pacific National Monument & USS *Arizona* Memorial\no   USS Missouri Battleship on Ford Island\no   Historic Downtown Honolulu (drive through only)\n\n• Driver reserves right to adjust route for maximum visitor enjoyment and safety\n• Be ready for spur-of-the-moment stops, unexpected views and special sightseeing along the way!\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTICE:**  \n\n• Bring government issued ID; security restrictions at Pearl Harbor will be enforced. CLEAR BAGS ONLY (no non see-through bags that could offer concealment.) Storage is available at Pearl Harbor for $8.00 per item.\n\n• Our tours do not allow guests to meet directly at Pearl Harbor. Guests must meet at one of the pick up locations offered; you may not drive out to Pearl Harbor on your own. \n\n• Attire: Dress comfortably, but please remember that shirts and footwear are required on the USS Arizona Memorial; swimsuits not permitted. High heels, dresses and skirts are not recommended. \n\n• Snacks and drinks are available and may be purchased independently at the Pearl Harbor Visitor Center and the USS Missouri gift shop.\n\n**NOTE:** Due to unforeseen circumstances beyond our control, the Navy may suspend boat operations to the USS Arizona Memorial at any time or impose a capacity restriction on the boat; as a result, occasionally, you may be placed in the standby line. Please accept our apologies in advance.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Tour 66A • Pick Up Starting at 6:30am", "short_description": null, "image_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/jEWLxe6SQ7ymcoET64Gw", "image_cdn_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/jEWLxe6SQ7ymcoET64Gw", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/items/9620/images/13886/", "pk": 13886, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/IzXegoHJQsWYxaAU95vK", "image_cdn_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/IzXegoHJQsWYxaAU95vK", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/items/9620/"}, "crop": {"y": 63, "x": 0, "width": 900, "url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/pe89KdazQrOg7flieMPJ", "height": 473}, "cropp